#X text 30 20 vb.freezer~ - spectral freeze into a mono Pd array;
#X text 30 47 Capture recent input and randomize its spectral phase to create a periodic loop.;
#X text 30 65 Turn DSP on \, capture \, then enable playback and raise output gain slowly.;
#X obj 30 103 tgl 20 0 empty empty DSP 25 10 0 10 #fcfcfc #000000 #000000 0 1;
#X msg 30 133 \; pd dsp \$1;
