#X msg 622 142 bgain 0;
#X text 382 370 Creation: vb.freezer~ <array-name> [capture-ms];
#X text 382 391 capture-ms defaults to 250 Send a bang after DSP has run.;
#X text 382 412 Inlet: audio plus messages. There is no signal outlet.;
#X text 382 433 Left outlet: loop / FFT length in samples. Right outlet: done bang.;
#X text 382 454 Processing runs in the background. Use the done bang for playback.;
#X text 382 486 set <name>: choose the mono destination array.;
#X text 382 507 freeze_buf: process all samples already in the target array.;
#X text 382 528 thresh <n>: discard FFT magnitudes below n (raw FFT units).;
#X text 382 549 bgain 0..1: old array gain. fgain 0..1: new frozen signal gain.;
#X text 382 570 Both gains default to 1 This patch sets bgain 0 to replace the loop.;
#X text 382 591 clear: zero the target array. info: print current settings.;
#X text 382 623 The array length sets the FFT and loop size (maximum 16777216).;
#X text 382 644 A shorter array keeps the latest captured samples that fit.;
#X text 382 665 Double-click array define to inspect the loop. Resize while idle.;
#X text 382 730 Original Max vb.freezer~ by Volker Boehm (2011-2020 \, v1.1.2).;
#X text 382 751 Pure Data port for xlab. Random phase changes the loop on each freeze.;
